claim.claim-text:
an interface (112), configured to receive the signal (SG0) of the electronic device (1210);
a hub controller (116), coupled to the interface (112) and the host (1220) and configured to determine whether the electronic device (1210) has high or low transmission speed based on the signal (SG0) of the electronic device received from the interface;
a control circuit (118), coupled to the hub controller (116) and configured to identify the type of the electronic device (1210) so as to generate type data (TD0); and
an Internet-of-Thing transceiver circuit (119), coupled to the control circuit (118), wherein the backend server (120) is communicatively connected to the Internet-of-Thing transceiver circuit (119).
